spes: read-only NAS/UIM look at the cellular side (0200, modem_nas=1).

First step towards mobile data. Once the modem announces NAS (QMI 3) and UIM (QMI 0x0B) over QRTR, every
30 s NAS Get Serving System (0x24) and Get Signal Strength (0x20), and once UIM Get Card Status (0x2F), from
our own client ports 0x4005/0x4006 in SpesModem's poll loop. Logged: registration and attach states, radio
technology, signal (dBm, LTE SNR), card and application states. Nothing is set; nothing identifying (IMSI,
ICCID, IMEI, AIDs) is requested or logged.

